  "term": "metaphor",
  "definition": "In this source, metaphor refers specifically to grammatical metaphor: a way of expressing meaning through grammatical forms rather than only through individual words. It is used as a framework for examining how language becomes more abstract and technical, especially in academic and scientific writing.",
